{"review_id": "36b70d19-34de-4785-b649-3b54d0e89b73", "package": "com.hevy", "app_name": "Hevy - Gym Log Workout Tracker", "language": "el", "language_name": "Greek", "rating": 5, "text": "I used to struggle with an Excel spreadsheet to build my workout program and track my progress. Then I found this app, and it completely changed everything. I've created all my workout routines in it, it automatically tracks my rest time between sets (so I don't need a separate timer), and I can log my progress in great detail. It also comes with ready-made workout programs, and you can even create a fully personalized training plan directly inside the app. Simply perfect!", "author": "Thodoris", "date": "2026-07-20T12:15:38Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "3.1.4", "developer_reply": null}
